WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.980
Security decisions need context.

2
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.560
What must be protected?

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.240
Where is it exposed?

4
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.940
And what evidence supports the protection?

5
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.440
SSTPA Tools brings those questions into
one connected

6
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.100
engineering model. Begin with the system
and its assets.

7
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.740
Trace them through operating states,
analyze paths to loss, and

8
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.240
connect controls to verifiable
requirements.

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.740
Build assurance arguments that reviewers
can examine, with the assumptions

10
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.920
and remaining vulnerabilities in view.

11
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.980
From the first architecture to integration
and sustainment,

12
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.420
SSTPA Tools keeps the security solution
connected to the system it

13
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.380
is meant to protect.

